\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 \strokec2 1. Executive Summary\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\fs28 \cf0 1.1 Product Overview\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Arnifi Marketing Studio is a self-service web application that enables Arnifi's internal teams to create professional, brand-consistent marketing creatives using predefined templates.\
Instead of creating every LinkedIn or Instagram post manually in Figma, users select an approved template, replace its text and images, adjust individual elements, preview the output, and download the finished creative.\
For the MVP, Claude Code will use the connected Figma MCP to inspect the provided Figma file, identify the 20 most suitable marketing designs, and recreate them as reusable, editable templates.\
The application must preserve the original visual quality of those designs while providing a simple, beginner-friendly editing experience.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 Core user journey:
\f1\b0 \
Template Library 
\f2 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  Select or Upload Template 
\f2 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  Customize Design 
\f2 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  Live Preview 
\f2 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  Export\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 1.2 Product Vision\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Enable any Arnifi marketing team member to create a professional, on-brand marketing creative within minutes, without requiring Figma knowledge or routine assistance from the design team.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

