\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 \strokec2 2. Problem Statement\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\fs28 \cf0 2.1 Current Problem\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Arnifi frequently needs marketing creatives for social media, campaigns, announcements, educational content, and business-related posts.\
The current process depends heavily on designers manually editing existing posters or recreating similar layouts.\
This creates several challenges:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Repeated design work for similar marketing posts.\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Marketing team dependency on designers for simple copy and image updates.\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Inconsistent layouts when designs are recreated manually.\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Time spent searching for existing poster designs.\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 No centralized, self-service template creation experience.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 These are the problems the MVP is intended to address. Their frequency and time impact should be validated with actual users rather than assumed.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 2.2 Proposed Solution\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Create a central web application containing approved Arnifi marketing templates.\
Users can choose a template and update its contents without redesigning the creative.\
The application's editor will handle common design adjustments while retaining the original structure and visual quality.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

