\fs28 \cf0 3.1 Primary Goals\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 G1 \'97 Self-service creation
\f1\b0 \
Allow a marketing user to create a finished post without using Figma.\

\f0\b G2 \'97 Template reusability
\f1\b0 \
Convert selected Figma posters into reusable editable templates.\

\f0\b G3 \'97 Brand consistency
\f1\b0 \
Preserve the original template styling and use Arnifi's existing design system.\

\f0\b G4 \'97 Faster production
\f1\b0 \
Reduce the number of manual editing steps needed to create a branded post.\

\f0\b G5 \'97 Stakeholder validation
\f1\b0 \
Provide a working prototype demonstrating that the concept is useful and technically feasible.\
