\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 12.3 Why Vite?\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 This MVP does not require server-side rendering or a complicated backend.\
Vite supports a lightweight frontend build that can be deployed as a static web application.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 12.4 Why Local-First Storage?\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 The initial application is intended for a stakeholder demonstration.\
Storing project state locally avoids unnecessary authentication, database setup, and cloud infrastructure.\
