\f0\b \cf0 Scenario:
\f1\b0  Arnifi's marketing team needs a new Instagram post promoting business setup in Dubai.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 Demonstration Steps\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 Step 1:
\f1\b0  Open Arnifi Marketing Studio.\
Show the centralized template library.\

\f0\b Step 2:
\f1\b0  Select a professional Instagram poster.\
Explain that the original design was prepared by Arnifi's designers in Figma.\

\f0\b Step 3:
\f1\b0  Open the editor.\
Show the original layout and editable layers.\

\f0\b Step 4:
\f1\b0  Change the heading.\
For example, replace the existing copy with:\
"Start your business in Dubai"\

\f0\b Step 5:
\f1\b0  Update the supporting description.\
Show the live canvas responding to the edit.\

\f0\b Step 6:
\f1\b0  Replace the image.\
Upload another relevant business image.\

\f0\b Step 7:
\f1\b0  Adjust positioning.\
Move the heading slightly upward and align it correctly.\

\f0\b Step 8:
\f1\b0  Manage brand elements.\
Show how the logo can be repositioned and the footer can be hidden or restored.\

\f0\b Step 9:
\f1\b0  Preview the final design.\
Demonstrate that the result looks like a professional Arnifi poster.\

\f0\b Step 10:
\f1\b0  Export the image.\
Download a PNG and open the finished output.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 Message to Stakeholders\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 "Previously, creating or modifying these posts required repeated involvement from the design team. With Arnifi Marketing Studio, the marketing team can use approved templates, edit the content independently, and export a brand-consistent creative in minutes."\
