\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Figma becomes the design source of truth, while Arnifi Marketing Studio becomes the self-service content production interface.\
Designers maintain approved designs; marketing team members customize and export them.\
