\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 Recommended Execution Order\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 First:
\f1\b0  Inspect the project and Figma sources.\

\f0\b Second:
\f1\b0  Inventory and rank eligible templates.\

\f0\b Third:
\f1\b0  Establish the editable template data model.\

\f0\b Fourth:
\f1\b0  Build a complete editing and export journey using one real template.\

\f0\b Fifth:
\f1\b0  Import and validate the remaining selected templates.\

\f0\b Sixth:
\f1\b0  Test and polish the application for stakeholder demonstration.\
Do not stop after producing a plan or screenshots. Implement the application, run it, and validate the core workflow wherever the development environment allows.\
