\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec2 25. Final Product Outcome\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Arnifi Marketing Studio should demonstrate a simple but valuable concept:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 One centralized place where Arnifi's teams can select professionally designed templates, customize their content, and produce brand-consistent marketing creatives without repeatedly relying on designers.
\f1\b0 \
The MVP succeeds when stakeholders can see that the process is simpler, the output quality is maintained, and the system has a clear path toward a scalable Figma-connected marketing design platform.\
